bug_report:
WriteString for String
Forwarded from the mailing list.

It would be useful to have WriteString (s: String) somewhere in the standard libraries.
Ie:

(* Like Terminal.WriteString, except that it takes a String, not an ARRAY OF 
CHAR. *)

PROCEDURE WriteString (s: String);
VAR
   l, i: CARDINAL;
BEGIN
   l := Length(s);
   i := 0;
   WHILE i < l DO
      Write(char(s, i));
      INC (i);
   END;
END WriteString;
